      "number": 1,
      "title": "The First Day",
      "content": "*Genesis is the meaning of this exodus, *\n*An absolute message with a modern methodology, *\n*I’m reaching for theology, fleeing sick technology, *\n*The need for peace empowers me, *\n*God finds me in the gives me the love I need, *\n\n*A love a need, a laugh I fiend when friends are beasts with hate that shows like smiling teeth, *\n*Flee from all toxicity, *\n*Looking for earth’s release of peace like Zion’s in the streets, *\n*The meek will meet and greet, so to speak, *\n*When Yahweh sharpens your face and path, it’s never bleak, *\n\nGOD GIVEN LIVING: \nThe central question: What did God have in mind when he put us on this planet? \n\nThe possible or plausible answer is to learn to LOVE. Living for love and loving to live while searching for wisdom is the quest of the daily Bible Pages reading. \n\n“It is the glory of God to conceal a thing:\nBut the honour of KINGS is to search out a matter.” \n\nIn this collaboration of this book in the JT_APP, you can sponsor a chapter with a topic that we will put into a chapter (roughly 1500 words or so). \n\nThe goal, hope and desire of the Daily Bible Pages is: \n\n***“That he would grant you, according to the riches of his glory, to be strengthened with might by his Spirit in the inner man .***\n***That Christ may dwell in your hearts by faith; that ye, being rooted and grounded in love,***\n***May be able to comprehend with all saints what is the breadth, and length, and depth, and height;***\n***And to know the love of Christ, which passeth knowledge, that ye might be filled with all the fulness of God.” ***\n**Ephesians 3: 16-19**\n\n\nThis quest will put us on an amazing quest to define a different dimension. \n\nThis Biblical task can only be done **“WITH ALL SAINTS”**. \n\nThe JT_APP’s Daily Bible Pages is a unique space to place what we can comprehend through time and space. \n\nMaking the first step in these passages. The king wants us to be part of all of this. \n\nThe Bible is *life* to me. \n\nWe didn’t choose it. It chose us…. \n\nThe Bible has outlived generations and we respect and revere it as pages written by Holy sages. The scripture are scripts forecasted by apostolic prophecies. \n\nThe Bible changed me.  It made me realize the realm of FAITH that makes all things possible.\nIt makes me SEEK MIRACLES! \n\nHaving the Daily Bible Pages means having a way to relate, connect and reflect *anything* in the Bible for *any day*. \n\nThe Old Testament for teaching of principles. \nThe New Testament shows us how to live with the Holy Spirit. \n\nThe Bible is **B**asic **I**nformation **B**efore **L**eaving **E**arth\n\nHaving this possibility to reach out for life, advice, counsel and entertainment is the goal of the daily Bible Pages. \n\nAnyone's life can change the moment they honestly… do something new.  \nMake a decision. Live for Love... Love to Live…. \n\nThe Bible Pages are created through spiritual inspiration. The authors of the Bible made words and supplied the essential teachings that are still relevant today. We can all learn something great in the Bible Pages. \n\nThere are many different ways of reading the Bible: \n\n**You can take the deep, slow approach:**\nDigesting each passage and looking up each word... You soak in it for a long time and meditate. \n\n**You can take the fast and swift approach.** \nTo increase wit, energy and knowledge. Taking it in doses and verses at increasing times a day.  \n\nEvery time you read the Bible, it's going to boost your senses. The way that it relates to you is linked to how you relate to life... or vice versa. \n\nYour mind will reflect the book in real life because the script is the scripture and you're the main character in God's eyes. \n\nYour daily actions are being watched and recorded like a hard drive that will be revealed on the day of revelation.  \nWhat we do in public and in secret is all important and it brings growth and meaning to our lives and our essence of being.  \n\nThis will bring the invisible, intangible and spiritual into the physical tangible and substantial. This is the work of the power of FAITH: ***Substance of things unseen…  ***\n\n\nThe Daily Bible Pages will be based on daily prayer and consistent reading of the Word. \n\n*Let this flourish and bring amazing works to life!  *\n\n*Bring delight and love to life,  *\n*Supply what makes your mind suffice,  *\n*Deny the pride and get a fresh supply of life.  *\n*Is money or the man that makes the mind?  *\n*A man makes money but what’s in the Master’s mind?  *\n*The Bible unearthed in Qumran simply not that hard to find…  *\n\nI will be adding insight, creations and ideas in this book that will be a canvas superimposed with God's own Words and plans.  \n\nHow has the Bible transformed you today?  ",
