      "id": "p022",
      "collection": "Spoken Word",
      "title": "Dolby Dub",
      "body": "If GOD is a server…\nWe enter His domain with our brains to drain all that our hearts contain. We live in his Holy Spirit of Wi-Fi on a path that's infinitely fast!\nWe're the computers, Jesus Christ's life was a software update that improved our processing system now we're of prophetic vision...\nThe devil is a virus but our software retracts upon attack!\nWe are a hard drive able to download happiness into a hard life. Replace the blame like Mandela after apartheid!",
