      "id": "p052",
      "collection": "Spoken Word",
      "title": "Cheesy Letter",
      "body": "It's harder to realize how world times and tides will change.\nBut nothing is strange since GOD has said there's nothing new under the sun...all things are fulfilled with skill in the passages of scripture, drunk with the spirit like I'm mixing elixir,\n\nMy words and vocab,\nSupporting most facts,\nAre fueled by all stats,\nOf GOD's involved hands,\nWith sons and all that.\n\nChrist is righteous, He's God in likeness,\nHe shows what life is, inspired, we might just try to raise the dead until HIS name is praised, and proclaimed!\nAlthough we may never evade the major pain, we do maintain a world of grace, and refrain from strange ways of sin and lust, mindful that it's never in vain!",
