      "id": "p054",
      "collection": "Spoken Word",
      "title": "How to diffuse a bomb",
      "body": "Which chords do I cut? This is madness…\nMalice maligned the masses!\nI'm just glad that the soul of Saul was controlled by Paul before he went to Damascus with a will to kill the masses!\nIt seems our future is proud of being ratchet, and as it happens, every child is called a bastard!\n\nWhat really happened?\nThe good old church-folk are more intrigued by magic!\nAnd I heard that news-guy prophecy that the planet is really damaged!\n\nMany find it hard to imagine how God could let this happen…\nISIS is spreading like bird flu and causing dramatic panic, the youth are killed by AIDs and planes and people are getting frantic!\n\nLet's just party hard, and after all the alcohol we'll be in a Lost World but not Jurassic.\nDrugs and carnal love to sway the mind are just another tactic! You only live once, no time for practice so you better perfect it.",
      "tags": [
        "spoken-word",
        "faith",
        "world",
        "chaos",
        "truth"
      ],
      "font": "Inter",
      "color": "#2c1810",
